    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS AND TRADE MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "課程目的在於透過實務參訪，廣邀業界經理人演講等方式，使學生瞭解國際貿易之管理及策略運作。",
    "describe_eh": "The objective of this course is to develop an understanding and application of international trade and management. Through sight visitation, the participation of professional managers, students will have in-depth understanding of how to apply the concepts of international trade and management in global setting.",
    "pre_subname": "BUS3129國際貿易實務",
    "pre_sub_id3": "BUS3129",
    "pre_sub_ename": "BUS3129 PRACTICES OF INTERNATIONAL TRADE",
